WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.900
Start in the admin

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.900
The Switch opens, with its tabs across the top

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.800
Add a brand starts with Step 0 · Check her

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.200
Clicked into Her website

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.400
Typed the brand's website

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.500
The duplicate check, then the Screen — about a third of a cent

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.600
Likely women-owned: her own site names a woman founder who still owns it

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.700
Unlocked — but you still confirm her ownership in Owner and proof

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:30.300
Start onboarding makes a hidden draft and opens step 1

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.500
Step 0 is done

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.800
Fetch ran by itself: 4 products wait at step 4; Awin doesn't know this domain

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.500
Description, logo and the one-line story

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Clicked into One-line story

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.900
Typed a one-line story in our own words

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.900
The hidden draft saves as you type — nothing is public

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.000
Step 2 · Owner & proof — filled in from the check

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.700
Her name, the evidence and where she's based came from the check — check them

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:54.500
Clicked into Women-owned %

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.500
Typed the women-owned share: 100

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.500
Date verified: the day you checked her ownership — one click for today

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.100
Clicked into Founder's email

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.700
Typed the founder's email (needed for the certification invitation)

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.900
Step 3 · Shopping

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:06.900
How clicks are paid: Direct (no affiliate network yet)

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.800
Ships from: same as where she's based

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:15.900
Step 4 · Products: the 4 products Fetch found

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:20.100
Each product gets a type and a why line; READY? shows when a row can publish

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.500
The rows, each Ready

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.300
Her category, under the table

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:26.600
Her category: used the suggestion

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:28.400
Back to the top of step 4

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:29.500
Step 5 · Review & publish: everything in one list

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:33.300
Owner and proof, all done

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:34.100
Shopping, Products, and the certification choice

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:38.600
Send the invitation to the founder after publishing (the usual choice)

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:41.100
Publishing…

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.100
Published: the brand is live with 4 products

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:48.100
Done: 4 products published. In this demo, nothing really went live
